; 4_voice_get_ready — YM2149 envelope-driven voice: "GET READY!"
;
; Each note in envelope mode auto-retriggers shape $0 (sharp attack,
; slow decay).  Q sets envelope period HIGH byte:
;   Q1 ~130 ms env cycle  (fast syllable)
;   Q2 ~260 ms env cycle  (normal syllable)
;   Q3 ~390 ms env cycle  (held vowel)
;
; Voice cadence: 4 syllables, descending pitch with rising exclamation.

T220
V14
O5
L32

Q2 E0
P3 D E
P0 F+ G G+ A G F+ E D

Q2 E0
P3 D E
P0 F+ G A B A G F+ E D

Q3 E0
P0 D D E E D D < B

Q1 E0
P0 > E F+ G A > C

~
